// Numeric tokenizer
// ============================================================================

/**
 * Tokenizer for numeric values (`Int`, `Long`, `Float`, `Double`, `BigDecimal`,
 * `BigInt`). Fractional values are formatted with the configured precision;
 * integral values are rendered via their natural string form.
